## Caption
**Figure 1. Self-referential framework of molecular stability based on the ψ = ψ(ψ) principle.** (A) Visualization of the recursive self-application that creates information echo patterns. (B) Multiple collapse paths representing different molecular configurations, with stable structures emerging at collapse entropy minima. (C) Conceptual bridge connecting quantum decoherence, information collapse, and classical thermodynamic stability through the unifying framework of collapse entropy (ℰ_collapse).

